  "description": "A database of the Gregorian repertory indexing chants, the manuscripts that carry them, and the calendars those manuscripts follow, including a calendar built on Hesbert's Antiphonale Missarum Sextuplex. Its pages are a finding aid and a cross-reference spine: each carries the database's own reading of a manuscript or an edition, not the manuscript or the edition itself, and nothing read off one is verified until collated against the witness it names.",
